ctices_Ideal_Product_Forms" >5. 最佳儲存實踐 &amp; 理想的產品形態</a><ul class='ez-toc-list-level-3' ><li class='ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-7" href="#_Storage_Tips" > 儲存技巧:</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-8" href="#Product_Types_Better_for_Long-Term_Storage" >更適合長期儲存的產品類型:</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-9" href="#Bulk_Purchasing_Tip" >大量採購技巧:</a></li></ul></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-10" href="#6_FAQs" >6. 常見問題解答:</a><ul class='ez-toc-list-level-3' ><li class='ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-11" href="#Does_milk_thistle_expire" >水飛薊會過期嗎?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-12" href="#Do_milk_thistle_supplements_go_bad" >奶薊補充劑會變質嗎?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-13" href="#How_long_does_milk_thistle_last" >水飛薊的保存期限是多久?</a></li></ul></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-14" href="#7_Conclusion_What_Buyers_Need_to_Know" >7. 結論: 買家需要了解什麼</a><ul class='ez-toc-list-level-3' ><li class='ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-15" href="#Explore_Bulk_Milk_Thistle_Products_%E2%86%92" >探索散裝水飛薊產品 →</a></li></ul></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-16" href="#References" >參考</a></li></ul></nav></div><h2 data-start="963" data-end="990"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="1_What_Is_Milk_Thistle"></span>1. 什麼是水飛薊?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="992" data-end="1232">水飛薊是一種原產於地中海地區的開花植物，通常用作草藥補充劑. 它的種子含有 <strong data-start="1122" data-end="1135">甲矽林</strong>, 一組具有抗氧化作用的黃酮木脂素, 消炎劑, 和保肝特性.</p><p data-start="1234" data-end="1350">水飛薊在傳統醫學的應用已有多年 2,000 年, 主要針對肝膽疾病.</p><hr data-start="1352" data-end="1355" /><h2 data-start="1357" data-end="1397"><img src="/images/Does-Milk-Thistle-Expire-300x300.jpg" decoding="async" class="wp-image-1140 aligncenter" alt="Does Milk Thistle Expire" width="565" height="565" title="水飛薊會過期嗎? 水飛薊能持續多久 &amp; 如何正確儲存 4" /></h2><h2 data-start="1357" data-end="1397"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="2_What_Part_of_Milk_Thistle_Is_Used"></span>2. 使用水飛薊的哪個部分?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="1399" data-end="1580">這 <strong data-start="1403" data-end="1434">種子 (也稱為瘦果)</strong> 水飛薊的主要部分用於藥用. 有時, 整個水果或粉碎的種子粉末用於茶和膠囊中.</p><h3 data-start="1582" data-end="1599"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Common_forms"></span>常見形式:<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul data-start="1600" data-end="1727"><li data-start="1600" data-end="1632"><p data-start="1602" data-end="1632">全脂水飛薊種子 (生的)</p></li><li data-start="1633" data-end="1653"><p data-start="1635" data-end="1653">磨碎的種子粉</p></li><li data-start="1654" data-end="1695"><p data-start="1656" data-end="1695">水飛薊素萃取物 (標準化 70–80%)</p></li><li data-start="1696" data-end="1727"><p data-start="1698" data-end="1727">油 (由種子冷壓而成)</p></li></ul><hr data-start="1729" data-end="1732" /><h2 data-start="1734" data-end="1782"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="3_Nutritional_Analysis_of_Milk_Thistle_Parts"></span>3. 水飛薊各部分的營養分析<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><div class="_tableContainer_16hzy_1"><div class="_tableWrapper_16hzy_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse" tabindex="-1"><table class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="2" data-start="1784" data-end="2460"><thead data-start="1784" data-end="1895"><tr data-start="1784" data-end="1895"><th data-start="1784" data-end="1809" data-col-size="sm">成分</th><th data-start="1809" data-end="1833" data-col-size="sm">整粒種子 (每100克)</th><th data-start="1833" data-end="1849" data-col-size="sm">磨粉</th><th data-start="1849" data-end="1875" data-col-size="sm">水飛薊素萃取物 (80%)</th><th data-start="1875" data-end="1895" data-col-size="sm">冷壓油</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="2009" data-end="2460"><tr data-start="2009" data-end="2121"><td data-start="2009" data-end="2034" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="2011" data-end="2024">甲矽林</strong></td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2034" data-end="2058">4–6%</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2058" data-end="2074">4–6%</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2074" data-end="2101">70–80%</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2101" data-end="2121">痕跡</td></tr><tr data-start="2122" data-end="2234"><td data-start="2122" data-end="2147" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="2124" data-end="2145">胖的 (主要是PUFA)</strong></td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2147" data-end="2171">25–30克</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2171" data-end="2187">25–30克</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2187" data-end="2214">&lt;1克</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2214" data-end="2234">～98克</td></tr><tr data-start="2235" data-end="2347"><td data-start="2235" data-end="2260" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="2237" data-end="2248">蛋白質</strong></td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2260" data-end="2284">18–20克</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2284" data-end="2300">18–20克</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2300" data-end="2327">&lt;1克</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2327" data-end="2347">0克</td></tr><tr data-start="2348" data-end="2460"><td data-start="2348" data-end="2373" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="2350" data-end="2373">保質期估計</strong></td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2373" data-end="2397">1–2 年</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2397" data-end="2413">12–18 個月</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2413" data-end="2440">2–3 年</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2440" data-end="2460">6–12 個月</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky end-(--thread-content-margin) h-0 self-end select-none"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end"></div></div></div></div><p data-start="2462" data-end="2475"><strong data-start="2462" data-end="2473">來源:</strong></p><ul data-start="2476" data-end="2630"><li data-start="2476" data-end="2517"><p data-start="2478" data-end="2517">歐洲藥品管理局 (EMA, 2018)</p></li><li data-start="2518" data-end="2568"><p data-start="2520" data-end="2568">我們. 農業部 (美國農業部) 資料庫</p></li><li data-start="2569" data-end="2630"><p data-start="2571" data-end="2630">美國國立衛生研究院 (美國衛生研究院) 草本補充劑的事實</p></li></ul><hr data-start="2632" data-end="2635" /><h2 data-start="2637" data-end="2683"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="4_What_Happens_When_Milk_Thistle_Goes_Bad"></span>4. 當水飛薊變質時會發生什麼?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="2685" data-end="2781">過期或保存不當時, 水飛薊可能會失去效力或產生有害的副產品:</p><ul data-start="2783" data-end="3158"><li data-start="2783" data-end="2895"><p data-start="2785" data-end="2895"><strong data-start="2785" data-end="2810">水飛薊素降解</strong>: 抗氧化活性降低 (來源: 藥學與藥理學雜誌, 2014)</p></li><li data-start="2896" data-end="2999"><p data-start="2898" data-end="2999"><strong data-start="2898" data-end="2913">酸敗的油</strong>: 冷壓油會氧化, 成型 <strong data-start="2950" data-end="2975">醛和酮</strong>, 哪些具有細胞毒性.</p></li><li data-start="3000" data-end="3158"><p data-start="3002" data-end="3158"><strong data-start="3002" data-end="3020">黴菌毒素風險</strong>: 暴露在潮濕的環境中可能會導致黴菌生長, 尤其 <strong data-start="3076" data-end="3098">黃麴</strong>, 可以產生 <strong data-start="3118" data-end="3132">黃麴毒素</strong>, 已知的肝癌致癌物.</p></li></ul><blockquote data-start="3160" data-end="3340"><p data-start="3162" data-end="3340">💡 根據 2021 學習於 <em data-start="3194" data-end="3208">食品控制</em>, 儲存不當的水飛薊種子表現出 3.4% 潮濕條件下可檢出黃麴毒素的污染率 65% 相對濕度.</p></blockquote><hr data-start="3342" data-end="3345" /><h2 data-start="3347" data-end="3397"><img src="/images/Does-Milk-Thistle-Expire-2-300x300.jpg" decoding="async" class="wp-image-1141 aligncenter" alt="Does Milk Thistle Expire" width="575" height="575" title="水飛薊會過期嗎? 水飛薊能持續多久 &amp; 如何正確儲存 5" /></h2><h2 data-start="3347" data-end="3397"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="5_Best_Storage_Practices_Ideal_Product_Forms"></span>5. 最佳儲存實踐 &amp; 理想的產品形態<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><h3 data-start="3399" data-end="3418"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="_Storage_Tips"></span> 儲存技巧:<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul data-start="3419" data-end="3532"><li data-start="3419" data-end="3453"><p data-start="3421" data-end="3453">儲存於 <strong data-start="3430" data-end="3453">密封容器</strong></p></li><li data-start="3454" data-end="3500"><p data-start="3456" data-end="3500">保存在一個 <strong data-start="3466" data-end="3500">涼爽的, 乾燥的地方 (&lt;25℃ / 77華氏度)</strong></p></li><li data-start="3501" data-end="3532"><p data-start="3503" data-end="3532">避免 <strong data-start="3509" data-end="3532">陽光 &amp; 濕度</strong></p></li></ul><h3 data-start="3534" data-end="3584"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Product_Types_Better_for_Long-Term_Storage"></span>更適合長期儲存的產品類型:<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><div class="_tableContainer_16hzy_1"><div class="_tableWrapper_16hzy_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse" tabindex="-1"><table class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="2" data-start="3586" data-end="4135"><thead data-start="3586" data-end="3675"><tr data-start="3586" data-end="3675"><th data-start="3586" data-end="3608" data-col-size="sm">產品類型</th><th data-start="3608" data-end="3621" data-col-size="sm">保存期限</th><th data-start="3621" data-end="3647" data-col-size="sm">最佳包裝</th><th data-start="3647" data-end="3675" data-col-size="sm">批量成本效益</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="3768" data-end="4135"><tr data-start="3768" data-end="3859"><td data-start="3768" data-end="3790" data-col-size="sm">整粒種子</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="3790" data-end="3803">18–24 個月</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="3803" data-end="3830">真空密封PE袋</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="3830" data-end="3859">★★★★★</td></tr><tr data-start="3860" data-end="3951"><td data-start="3860" data-end="3882" data-col-size="sm">水飛薊素萃取物</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="3882" data-end="3895">24–36 個月</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="3895" data-end="3922">鋁箔袋</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="3922" data-end="3951">★★★★☆</td></tr><tr data-start="3952" data-end="4043"><td data-start="3952" data-end="3974" data-col-size="sm">磨粉</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="3974" data-end="3987">12–18個月</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="3987" data-end="4014">密封 HDPE 容器</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="4014" data-end="4043">★★★☆☆</td></tr><tr data-start="4044" data-end="4135"><td data-start="4044" data-end="4066" data-col-size="sm">冷壓油</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="4066" data-end="4079">6–12 個月</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="4079" data-end="4106">琥珀色玻璃瓶</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="4106" data-end="4135">★★☆☆☆</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky end-(--thread-content-margin) h-0 self-end select-none"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end"></div></div></div></div><h3 data-start="4137" data-end="4161"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Bulk_Purchasing_Tip"></span>大量採購技巧:<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><blockquote data-start="4162" data-end="4323"><p data-start="4164" data-end="4323">選擇 <strong data-start="4171" data-end="4186">整個種子</strong> 或者 <strong data-start="4190" data-end="4225">標準化水飛薊素萃取物</strong> 和 <strong data-start="4231" data-end="4238">COA</strong> 和 <strong data-start="4243" data-end="4259">水分 &lt;8%</strong>, 真空密封在鋁或 PE 內袋中，外加紙箱.</p></blockquote><hr data-start="4325" data-end="4328" /><h2 data-start="4330" data-end="4373"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="6_FAQs"></span>6. 常見問題解答:<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><h3 data-start="4375" data-end="4408"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Does_milk_thistle_expire"></span><strong data-start="4379" data-end="4408">水飛薊會過期嗎?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="4409" data-end="4544">是的, 奶薊草像所有天然產品一樣會過期. 取決於形式和存儲, 其保存期限範圍為 <strong data-start="4520" data-end="4543">6 幾個月 3 年</strong>.</p><h3 data-start="4546" data-end="4589"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Do_milk_thistle_supplements_go_bad"></span><strong data-start="4550" data-end="4589">奶薊補充劑會變質嗎?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="4590" data-end="4754">是的. 過期的水飛薊補充劑可能會失去效力，並可能變質或被黴菌污染. 經常檢查 <strong data-start="4709" data-end="4725">有效期限</strong> 和 <strong data-start="4730" data-end="4753">包裝完整性</strong>.</p><h3 data-start="4756" data-end="4796"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="How_long_does_milk_thistle_last"></span><strong data-start="4760" data-end="4796">水飛薊的保存期限是多久?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul data-start="4797" data-end="4903"><li data-start="4797" data-end="4828"><p data-start="4799" data-end="4828">整粒種子: 最多 24 月份</p></li><li data-start="4829" data-end="4857"><p data-start="4831" data-end="4857">提煉: 最多 36 月份</p></li><li data-start="4858" data-end="4882"><p data-start="4860" data-end="4882">粉末: 12–18 個月</p></li><li data-start="4883" data-end="4903"><p data-start="4885" data-end="4903">油: 6–12 個月</p></li></ul><hr data-start="4905" data-end="4908" /><h2 data-start="4910" data-end="4952"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="7_Conclusion_What_Buyers_Need_to_Know"></span>7. 結論: 買家需要了解什麼<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="4954" data-end="5258">基於 EMA 的驗證數據和研究, 美國農業部, 和同行評審期刊, <strong data-start="5038" data-end="5118">水飛薊的保存期限在很大程度上取決於其形狀和儲存條件</strong>. 尋求最長保質期和品質保證的大宗買家應優先考慮 <strong data-start="5203" data-end="5257">標準化萃取物或真空包裝的整粒種子</strong>.</p><p data-start="5260" data-end="5375">如果您正在採購 <strong data-start="5279" data-end="5330">水飛薊種子, 粉末, 或大量提取</strong>, 訪問我們的 <a class="" href="#" rel="noopener" data-start="5342" data-end="5363"><strong data-start="5343" data-end="5359">產品頁面</strong></a> 探索:</p><ul data-start="5377" data-end="5529"><li data-start="5377" data-end="5409"><p data-start="5379" data-end="5409">完整的COA + 3研發方測試</p></li><li data-start="5410" data-end="5445"><p data-start="5412" data-end="5445">出口客製化包裝</p></li><li data-start="5446" data-end="5479"><p data-start="5448" data-end="5479">有競爭力的批發價格</p></li><li data-start="5480" data-end="5529"><p data-start="5482" data-end="5529">來自認證生產基地的全球交付</p></li></ul><hr data-start="5531" data-end="5534" /><h3 data-start="5536" data-end="5584"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Explore_Bulk_Milk_Thistle_Products_%E2%86%92"></span><a href="/zh-tw/milk-thistle-seed-bulk-north-china-production/">探索散裝水飛薊產品 →</a><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><hr data-start="5586" data-end="5589" /><h2 data-start="5591" data-end="5607"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="References"></span>參考<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><ol data-start="5609" data-end="6013"><li data-start="5609" data-end="5716"><p data-start="5612" data-end="5716">EMA. (2018). <em data-start="5625" data-end="5686">水飛薊評估報告 (L。) 蓋爾滕。, 水果</em>. 歐洲藥品管理局.</p></li><li data-start="5717" data-end="5791"><p data-start="5720" data-end="5791">美國國立衛生研究院膳食補充品辦公室. (2022). <em data-start="5763" data-end="5788">水飛薊情況說明書</em>.</p></li><li data-start="5792" data-end="5887"><p data-start="5795" data-end="5887">藥學與藥理學雜誌 (2014). &#8220;草藥製劑中水飛薊素的穩定性&#8221;.</p></li><li data-start="5888" data-end="5915"><p data-start="5891" data-end="5915">美國農業部食品資料中心.</p></li><li data-start="5916" data-end="6013"><p data-start="5919" data-end="6013"><em data-start="5919" data-end="5933">食品控制</em>, 體積 123, 2021: “儲存的水飛薊種子存在黃麴毒素污染風險。”</p></li></ol>`} />
